    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Defence is an idle-farming simulator with defence content. This game is designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while your farm is woking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Grow Crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, use your drone to automatically grow crops. Better crops will cost some money to seed, but will give more fuel to activate your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Produce Fuel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use crops to produce fuel to run your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Defend your Farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies will run to your town hall every few minuets. Place turrets to defend your town hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don`t worry. There is no game over in this game. When your town hall is broken, all zombies will disappear and you can try again.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Defence is an idle-farming simulator with defence content. This game is designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while your farm is woking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Grow Crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, use your drone to automatically grow crops. Better crops will cost some money to seed, but will give more fuel to activate your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Produce Fuel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use crops to produce fuel to run your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Defend your Farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies will run to your town hall every few minuets. Place turrets to defend your town hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don`t worry. There is no game over in this game. When your town hall is broken, all zombies will disappear and you can try again.</p>",
    "short_description": "Idle-farming game with automation. The game will\u00a0sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks. Grow crops, produce fuel, activate turrets to defend your FARM.",
